sequenceDiagram
  actor E as Employee
  participant U as Vue application
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant Z as Authorization
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Queue
  participant G as LangGraph worker
  participant R as Retrieval
  participant M as Model gateway
  participant V as Validators and rules
  participant H as Review service

  E->>U: Open authorized claim
  U->>A: GET claim workspace
  A->>Z: Authorize tenant, role, assignment
  Z-->>A: Permit with resource scope
  A->>D: Load authoritative claim view
  D-->>A: Claim, document, artifact statuses
  A-->>U: Workspace

  E->>U: Start analysis
  U->>A: POST analysis with idempotency key
  A->>Z: Authorize action
  A->>D: Commit run, snapshot, outbox event
  A-->>U: 202 and analysis URL
  A->>Q: Publish outbox job
  Q->>G: Deliver job at least once
  G->>D: Claim idempotent run and load snapshot
  G->>R: Retrieve authorized evidence
  R->>D: Hybrid FTS and vector query with filters
  D-->>R: Ranked evidence objects
  R-->>G: Evidence and provenance
  G->>M: Structured task with bounded evidence
  M-->>G: Parsed output and usage metadata
  G->>V: Validate citations, policy version, rules, support
  V-->>G: Results and escalation reasons

  alt Mandatory review
    G->>H: Create snapshot-bound review task
    H->>D: Persist interrupt and task
    G-->>U: SSE status: human review required
  else Supported decision support
    G->>D: Persist immutable artifact and audit events
    G-->>U: SSE status: completed
  end
  U->>A: GET artifact, evidence, and assessment
  A->>Z: Reauthorize resources
  A-->>U: Authorized decision-support view
